{"mode": "live", "backend": "cli", "model": "sonnet", "seconds": 50.3, "shop": "小滿便當（模擬店家）", "steps": [{"i": 1, "thought": "剛開始，先看資料夾裡有哪些檔案。", "tool": "list_files", "args": {}, "result": {"files": ["A_ads.csv", "A_items.csv", "A_orders.csv", "B_ads.csv", "B_items.csv", "B_orders.csv", "contract.json", "menu_costs.csv", "owner_note.txt", "platform_menu.csv", "pos_direct.csv", "promos.csv"]}, "t": 2.8}, {"i": 2, "thought": "先讀老闆備註、合約、並看各對帳單的表頭，了解欄位與限制。", "tool": "read_file", "args": {"names": ["owner_note.txt", "contract.json", "A_orders.csv", "A_items.csv", "A_ads.csv", "B_orders.csv", "B_items.csv", "B_ads.csv", "menu_costs.csv", "platform_menu.csv", "pos_direct.csv", "promos.csv"], "max_lines": 4}, "result": {"owner_note.txt": {"total_lines": 4, "head": ["老闆備註：", "1. 素食便當是我們的招牌，不能下架，要漲的話最多漲 10 元。", "2. 平台 A 的「滿 199 折 40（店家全額負擔）」（活動代碼 A-PROMO1）是跟業務簽好的，這個月還不能退。", "3. 其他品項可以調，但單一品項不要一次漲超過兩成，客人會嚇到。"]}, "contract.json": {"total_lines": 21, "head": ["{", " \"bag_cost\": 4,", " \"shop\": \"小滿便當（模擬店家）\",", " \"month\": \"2026-10\",", " \"A\": {", "  \"label\": \"平台 A（熊貓型・模擬）\",", "  \"rate\": 0.32,", "  \"rate_next\": 0.34500000000000003,", "  \"next_effective\": \"2026-11-01\",", "  \"base\": \"net\",", "  \"tax\": 0.05", " },", " \"B\": {", "  \"label\": \"平台 B（UE 型・模擬）\",", "  \"rate\": 0.325,", "  \"rate_next\": 0.325,", "  \"next_effective\": null,", "  \"base\": \"gross\",", "  \"tax\": 0.05", " }", "}"]}, "A_orders.csv": {"total_lines": 995, "head": ["訂單編號,訂單日期,商品小計,店家負擔折扣,平台負擔折扣,活動代碼,佣金,佣金營業稅,廣告活動,調整金額,調整說明品項,撥款金額", "A03-00001,2026-10-11,305,40,0,A-PROMO1,85,4,,0,,176", "A03-00002,2026-10-01,150,0,0,,48,2,,0,,100", "A03-00003,2026-10-10,245,40,0,A-PROMO1,66,3,,0,,136"]}, "A_items.csv": {"total_lines": 1947, "head": ["訂單編號,品項,數量,單價", "A03-00001,雙主菜便當,1,175", "A03-00001,燙青菜,2,45", "A03-00001,貢丸湯,1,40"]}, "A_ads.csv": {"total_lines": 63, "head": ["日期,廣告活動,花費", "2026-10-01,A-AD1,37", "2026-10-02,A-AD1,37", "2026-10-03,A-AD1,37"]}, "B_orders.csv": {"total_lines": 991, "